            "detailed_description": "Half Human, Half Hungry<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRaider of the lost Nosh!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrehistorik, a member of the T-Bone Tribe, is hungry and ready for a bronco lunch! Armed with Diner-Club, his faithful frazzler, he sets off on his food-spotting expedition. Follow Prehistorik from the unexplored ice-fields of Antarctica, the darkened mysterious caverns of the shady continent to the lush jungles of the Tropics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing<br />\r\n- Rhino Dendron<br />\r\n- King-Kongorus XII<br />\r\n- Chimp-Agogo<br />\r\n- Boa-Dee-Sauce<br />\r\n- Pyro-Tax<br />\r\n- And many other Chops<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLunch is served!",
            "about_the_game": "Half Human, Half Hungry<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRaider of the lost Nosh!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrehistorik, a member of the T-Bone Tribe, is hungry and ready for a bronco lunch! Armed with Diner-Club, his faithful frazzler, he sets off on his food-spotting expedition. Follow Prehistorik from the unexplored ice-fields of Antarctica, the darkened mysterious caverns of the shady continent to the lush jungles of the Tropics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing<br />\r\n- Rhino Dendron<br />\r\n- King-Kongorus XII<br />\r\n- Chimp-Agogo<br />\r\n- Boa-Dee-Sauce<br />\r\n- Pyro-Tax<br />\r\n- And many other Chops<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLunch is served!",
            "short_description": "Eat and beat your way through 150 scenes of awesome nourishing fun and relive the &quot;Prehistorik&quot; epic in this incredible platform game. Armed with your Diner Club Anticus, an ancestor of the baseball bat, you start in pursuit of the hilarious Maxidocus and take on armies of hairy spiders...",
